{"title":"List of United States college mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#National_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#International_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">International competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#State_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">State competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_competitions\">National competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_college_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: National competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=William_Lowell_Putnam_Mathematical_Competition\" title=\"William Lowell Putnam Mathematical Competition\">William Lowell Putnam Mathematical Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMATYC_Student_Mathematics_League\" title=\"AMATYC Student Mathematics League\">AMATYC Student Mathematics League</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.amatyc.org/?StudentMathLeague\">for two-year colleges</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://cronus.mcs.alma.edu/mathchallenge/HistoryPage.html\">MATH Challenge</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.vt.edu/\">Virginia Tech Regional Mathematics Contest</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://simiode.org/scudem\">SIMIODE SCUDEM</a> -- SIMIODE's (Systemic Initiative for Modeling Investigations and Opportunities using Differential Equations) \"Student Competition Using Differential Equations Modeling\" (SCUDEM)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"International_competitions\">International competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_college_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: International competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematics_Competition\" title=\"International Mathematics Competition\">International Mathematics Competition</a> (IMC)</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"State_competitions\">State competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_college_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: State competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.gc.peachnet.edu/math/tournament/\">Gainesville State College Math Tournament</a> for two-year colleges in Georgia.  <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mercer_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mercer University (page does not exist)\">Mercer University</a> scholarships are awarded to winners.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.iowa.maa.org/\">Iowa Collegiate Mathematics Competition</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.uiuc.edu/contests.html\">University of Illinois at Urbana Champaign Undergraduate Math Contest (UIUC)</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nysmatyc.org/league/\">NYSMATYC (New York State Mathematics Association of Two-Year Colleges) Math League</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_college_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">Math books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics scholarships\">Mathematics scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018093429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 15/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache